sequenceDiagram
    participant S1 as Stage 1
    participant FMR as Mock FMR
    S1->>FMR: GET /health
    alt FMR reachable
        S1->>FMR: POST /ws/public/data/validate (SDMX-CSV)
        FMR-->>S1: FMR report (Position-indexed errors)
    else offline
        S1->>S1: validate_dataset() in-process
    end
    S1->>S1: drop rows at invalid positions
    S1->>S1: write validated_submissions.jsonl
